    "name": "Security Guard",
    "steam_appid": 1421190,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421190/extras/95e9275fb872ca6acf40074f49876bc0.poster.avif?t=1752661617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421190/extras/95e9275fb872ca6acf40074f49876bc0.webm?t=1752661617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About</h2><br><strong>Security Guard</strong> - a brand new game from the simulation category, which will allow you to become a security guard known from the most exciting action movies. Many interesting missions, equipment and various locations await you. However, life is not so easy. Your first day will look a bit different from guarding the most important celebrities, but don't worry! Everyone started with nothing.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421190/extras/285034b1bf481cb2ec20fd38542de336.poster.avif?t=1752661617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421190/extras/285034b1bf481cb2ec20fd38542de336.webm?t=1752661617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Character</h2> Your man has his own personality. You can upgrade his skills and make him the best guard in the city. You decide if you want to be sneaky, fast or just clumsy.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421190/extras/da9808a705b18fd906d44050194caa5b.poster.avif?t=1752661617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421190/extras/da9808a705b18fd906d44050194caa5b.webm?t=1752661617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weapons</h2>Different missions require different weapons. Choose between pistols, rifles and other types of them. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421190/extras/bea195f4344543b52fe4d9e5aa75ccfa.poster.avif?t=1752661617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421190/extras/bea195f4344543b52fe4d9e5aa75ccfa.webm?t=1752661617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Locations</h2>We prepared many interesting locations like houses or celebities' villas. They are very specific so you have to be careful during planning.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421190/extras/d236d27d446e6adedeb9c7b6f7fd3218.poster.avif?t=1752661617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421190/extras/d236d27d446e6adedeb9c7b6f7fd3218.webm?t=1752661617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Equipment</h2>When securing the location, various precautions are available such as motion detectors, alarms for doors, windows and locks etc. You need to install them properly in tactical locations to have the greatest advantage!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421190/extras/4fbb4c0fab89e76faf26d22b48d81c1c.poster.avif?t=1752661617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421190/extras/4fbb4c0fab89e76faf26d22b48d81c1c.webm?t=1752661617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
