\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weapons</h2>Different missions require different weapons. Choose between pistols, rifles and other types of them. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421190/extras/bea195f4344543b52fe4d9e5aa75ccfa.poster.avif?t=1752661617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421190/extras/bea195f4344543b52fe4d9e5aa75ccfa.webm?t=1752661617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Locations</h2>We prepared many interesting locations like houses or celebities' villas. They are very specific so you have to be careful during planning.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421190/extras/d236d27d446e6adedeb9c7b6f7fd3218.poster.avif?t=1752661617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421190/extras/d236d27d446e6adedeb9c7b6f7fd3218.webm?t=1752661617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Equipment</h2>When securing the location, various precautions are available such as motion detectors, alarms for doors, windows and locks etc. You need to install them properly in tactical locations to have the greatest advantage!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421190/extras/4fbb4c0fab89e76faf26d22b48d81c1c.poster.avif?t=1752661617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421190/extras/4fbb4c0fab89e76faf26d22b48d81c1c.webm?t=1752661617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
